 "MarkdownNote", "title": "参考图尺寸设置", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [445.22418212890625, 247.5373077392578], "pos": [2270.8583984375, 1951.6944580078125], "id": 113, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 8}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["Cache 节点：减少重复加载，大幅节省显存、提速\n**核心作用：缓存 Qwen Image2.1 的模型权重，减少重复加载，大幅节省显存、提速**\n\n1. **device（auto）**：自动选择设备，一般自动把模型放到显卡 GPU；可选 cpu，显存不够时临时用，但速度很慢。\n2. **dtype（default）**：权重精度，默认跟随你加载主模型的精度（bf16/int8），不用手动改动。\n\n### 原理\n\n不加这个节点：每次点生成，都会反复重新加载巨大的 Qwen 主模型，浪费时间，反复占用释放显存，容易爆显存。\n加上 Cache 节点：**模型加载一次后常驻缓存**，连续多次出图、反复跑同工作流，不用重复载入模型，减少等待、降低 OOM 风险。\n\n### 注意\n\n- 只对**连续多次生成**有收益；单次生成，提升效果很小。\n- 如果切换不同主模型，需要清空缓存，不然会报错。\n- device 保持 auto 即可，绝大多数场景不用改。\n\n一句话总结：**模型缓存节点，预加载并留住模型在显存里，连续批量出图提速、减少显存反复波动**。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {"collapsed": true}, "type": "Note", "title": "减少重复加载、省显存", "mode": 4, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [326.4676513671875, 157.19833374023438], "pos": [2638.0107421875, 2147.978759765625], "id": 114, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "version": "7.0.1"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 9}, {"mode": 4, "outputs": [{"name": "MODEL", "links": [178], "label": "MODEL", "type": "MODEL", "localized_name": "MODEL"}], "size": [307.4762268066406, 82], "pos": [1933.866455078125, 2082.68896484375], "widgets_values": ["qwen_image_2.1_bf16.safetensors", "default"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "unet_name"}, "name": "unet_name", "label": "unet_name", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "unet_name"}, {"widget": {"name": "weight_dtype"}, "name": "weight_dtype", "label": "weight_dtype", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "weight_dtype"}], "flags": {}, "id": 118, "type": "UNETLoader", "properties": {"models": [{"directory_invalid": true, "name": "qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors", "directory": "diffusion_models", "url": "https://huggingface.co/Comfy-Org/Qwen-Image-2.1/resolve/main/diffusion_models/qwen_image_2.1_int8_convrot.safetensors"}], "widget_ue_con